<th id="S4.T1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">o1 (zero-shot)</th>
<td id="S4.T1.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">70%</td>
